      <ex type="phr"><ex_orig>när allt kommer omkring ("när allt tas med i beräkningen")</ex_orig><ex_transl>when all is said and done (&quot;when everything is taken into account&quot;)</ex_transl></ex>
      <ex type="phr"><ex_orig>komma ihåg ("minnas")</ex_orig><ex_transl>remember (&quot;keep in memory&quot;)</ex_transl></ex>
