      <ex type="exm"><ex_orig>bilen strejkade i morse</ex_orig><ex_transl>the car wouldn&amp;#39;t start (run) this morning</ex_transl>      </ex>
      <def>gå i strejk, lägga ner arbetet</def>
    </def>
  </ar>
