      <ex type="phr"><ex_orig>jag har sysslat med lite av varje (&quot;med flera olika saker&quot;)</ex_orig><ex_transl>I have done a little of everything (&amp;quot;all sorts of things&amp;quot;)</ex_transl></ex>
      <ex type="phr"><ex_orig>till varje pris (&quot;vad det än må kosta&quot;)</ex_orig><ex_transl>at any price (&amp;quot;whatever the cost&amp;quot;)</ex_transl></ex>
      <ex type="phr"><ex_orig>i varje fall (&quot;åtminstone&quot;)</ex_orig><ex_transl>in any case, at all events (&amp;quot;at least&amp;quot;)</ex_transl></ex>
